{"version":3,"clips":[{"id":"hero-served","role":"hero","text":"You've been served!","file":"audio/neural/andrew-instruct-v1/hero-served.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","durationSeconds":0.92},{"id":"hero-serve","role":"hero","text":"The Son did not come to be served, but to serve.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-instruct-v1/hero-serve.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","durationSeconds":3.04},{"id":"hero-selfish","role":"hero","text":"Wow. This planet is selfish.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-instruct-v1/hero-selfish.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","durationSeconds":2.12},{"id":"hero-help","role":"hero","text":"Don't worry. I've got you.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-instruct-v1/hero-help.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","durationSeconds":1.76},{"id":"citizen-saved","role":"citizen","text":"I've been saved!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-v1/citizen-saved.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","durationSeconds":1.2},{"id":"citizen-thanks","role":"citizen","text":"Thank you, Jesus!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-v1/citizen-thanks.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","durationSeconds":2.8},{"id":"citizen-boyfriend","role":"citizen","text":"Please Jesus, save me from my narcissistic boyfriend!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-v1/citizen-boyfriend.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","durationSeconds":3.84},{"id":"citizen-girlfriend","role":"citizen","text":"Please Jesus, save me from my narcissistic girlfriend!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-v1/citizen-girlfriend.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","durationSeconds":4.4},{"id":"citizen-somebody","role":"citizen","text":"I can finally think about somebody else!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-v1/citizen-somebody.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","durationSeconds":2.16},{"id":"citizen-aboutme","role":"citizen","text":"Wait. Everything isn't about me?","file":"audio/neural/crowd-v1/citizen-aboutme.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","durationSeconds":2.88},{"id":"hero-v3-reflection-universe","role":"hero","text":"Some people expect the whole universe to revolve around them. Even the sun has the courtesy to share its light.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-reflection-universe.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero_reflection","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":7.16},{"id":"hero-v3-reflection-hearing","role":"hero","text":"I've heard prayers from every corner of this city. Somehow, the loudest ego still thinks it's the only voice here.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-reflection-hearing.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero_reflection","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":6.88},{"id":"hero-v3-reflection-marketplace","role":"hero","text":"I came here to help people find peace. Apparently, first we need to explain that the marketplace has other customers.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-reflection-marketplace.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero_reflection","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":7.08},{"id":"hero-v3-rescue-coming-through","role":"hero","text":"Coming through! A little room for mercy, and perhaps one fewer speech about yourself.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-rescue-coming-through.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero_rescue","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"obstruction","durationSeconds":5.72},{"id":"hero-v3-rescue-safe-passage","role":"hero","text":"There we go. Safe passage, fresh air, and absolutely no applause required.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-rescue-safe-passage.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero_rescue","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":5.52},{"id":"hero-v3-rescue-entrance","role":"hero","text":"I've got you. We can discuss my dramatic entrance after you're safely through.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-rescue-entrance.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero_rescue","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.56},{"id":"hero-v3-rescue-sandals","role":"hero","text":"Mercy coming through! Yes, even for the gentleman reviewing my sandals.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-rescue-sandals.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero_rescue","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.32},{"id":"hero-v3-boss-lovebomb","role":"hero","text":"That's a lot of compliments for someone who hasn't asked my name.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-boss-lovebomb.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"boss_LoveBomb","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.64},{"id":"hero-v3-boss-mirror","role":"hero","text":"You can copy my sandals. You'll have to do your own inner work.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/canary-01/hero-v3-boss-mirror.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"boss_Mirror","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":3.96},{"id":"hero-v3-boss-fakebond","role":"hero","text":"We share a favorite bread. That is not a lifelong contract.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-boss-fakebond.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"boss_FakeBond","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.24},{"id":"hero-v3-boss-devalue","role":"hero","text":"My worth isn't on sale. You're welcome to browse elsewhere.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-boss-devalue.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"boss_Devalue","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.24},{"id":"hero-v3-boss-discard","role":"hero","text":"You can't banish me from an argument I already left.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-boss-discard.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"boss_Discard","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":2.96},{"id":"hero-v3-boss-smear","role":"hero","text":"That rumor travels fast. Pity it didn't bring any facts.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/retry-02/hero-v3-boss-smear.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"boss_SmearCampaign","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.92},{"id":"hero-v3-boss-hoover","role":"hero","text":"Another grand return? I'm beginning to recognize the entrance music.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-boss-hoover.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"boss_Hoover","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.36},{"id":"hero-v3-grayrock","role":"hero","text":"I'll gray rock him.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/retry-02/hero-v3-grayrock.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero-grayrock","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":1.44},{"id":"hero-v3-nocontact","role":"hero","text":"No contact. All peace.","file":"audio/neural/andrew-dialogue-v3/batch-01/hero-v3-nocontact.wav","voice":"Local clone of cached Microsoft AndrewNeural","engine":"CosyVoice3.inference_instruct2","category":"hero-nocontact","gender":"male","persona":"hero","context":"general","durationSeconds":2.6},{"id":"citizen-v3-birthday","role":"citizen","text":"Jesus, help! He turned my birthday into a celebration of his generosity!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/canary-01/citizen-v3-birthday.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"female","persona":"seeking-help","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.56},{"id":"citizen-v3-reflection","role":"citizen","text":"A little help, please! Every conversation somehow ends at his reflection.","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-reflection.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"female","persona":"seeking-help","context":"general","durationSeconds":5.28},{"id":"citizen-v3-committee","role":"citizen","text":"Jesus! I said no, and now there's apparently a committee!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-committee.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"female","persona":"seeking-help","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.16},{"id":"citizen-v3-space","role":"citizen","text":"Please help me get some space. Even my shadow needs a break.","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-space.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"female","persona":"seeking-help","context":"general","durationSeconds":5.28},{"id":"citizen-v3-directions","role":"citizen","text":"Jesus, help! I asked for directions and got her entire acceptance speech!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-directions.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"male","persona":"seeking-help","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.64},{"id":"citizen-v3-donkey","role":"citizen","text":"Over here! He borrowed my donkey and renamed it after himself!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-donkey.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"male","persona":"donkey-owner","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.24},{"id":"citizen-v3-quiet-street","role":"citizen","text":"Jesus! Is there a quiet street where nobody is evaluating my importance?","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-quiet-street.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"male","persona":"seeking-help","context":"general","durationSeconds":5.28},{"id":"citizen-v3-sharing","role":"citizen","text":"A hand, please! She calls it sharing, but I'm carrying everything!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/retry-02/citizen-v3-sharing.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenplea","gender":"male","persona":"seeking-help","context":"general","durationSeconds":3.44},{"id":"citizen-v3-own-thoughts","role":"citizen","text":"Thank you! I can hear my own thoughts again. They're surprisingly reasonable!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-own-thoughts.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"female","persona":"grateful","context":"general","durationSeconds":6.72},{"id":"citizen-v3-testimonial","role":"citizen","text":"I've been saved, and nobody even asked me to write a testimonial!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-testimonial.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"female","persona":"grateful","context":"general","durationSeconds":5.04},{"id":"citizen-v3-feelings","role":"citizen","text":"Oh! Other people have feelings. This explains several very awkward afternoons.","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-feelings.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"female","persona":"self-reflecting","context":"general","durationSeconds":6.24},{"id":"citizen-v3-scenic-route","role":"citizen","text":"Thank you, Jesus! I'm taking the scenic route around that argument.","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-scenic-route.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural female","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"female","persona":"grateful","context":"general","durationSeconds":5.52},{"id":"citizen-v3-luggage","role":"citizen","text":"You've saved me! I was one compliment away from carrying his luggage!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-luggage.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"male","persona":"grateful","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.16},{"id":"citizen-v3-invoice","role":"citizen","text":"Wait, kindness doesn't come with an invoice? I should try this!","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-invoice.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"male","persona":"grateful","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.8},{"id":"citizen-v3-dramatic-exit","role":"citizen","text":"I've been saved! And somehow, my dramatic exit feels less necessary.","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-dramatic-exit.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"male","persona":"self-reflecting","context":"general","durationSeconds":4.96},{"id":"citizen-v3-return-donkey","role":"citizen","text":"Thank you! I'll return the donkey. His name was fine already.","file":"audio/neural/crowd-dialogue-v3/batch-01/citizen-v3-return-donkey.wav","voice":"Local Qwen3 natural male","engine":"Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-VoiceDesign","category":"citizenreaction","gender":"male","persona":"donkey-borrower","context":"general","durationSeconds":7.44}]}